Cell["\<\
These small sample counts are for an interactive example. The fit and \
validation use different kinematic samples with the model's parameter \
values. Increase them, and add other theory-consistent \
ValidationParameterRules, for a more extensive test. Success at this stage \
establishes only the sampled physical-factorization constraints.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dad05d55-8a15-4c63-b152-f6e9c8db42ea"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5. Complete High Energy and Verify", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"809fa82c-a8c5-49e4-9431-d37a2d9a84a9"],

Cell["\<\
Run this stage only after factorization is complete. It checks physical \
residues again, together with high-energy growth, spurious-pole cancellation \
and explicit Xi independence. It does not necessarily find the shortest \
expression.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8f05d2eb-7bef-45ae-b9b3-774c335de9a4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
completion = If[FailureQ[factorization] || factorization === $Failed,
  factorization,
  CompleteHighEnergy[factorization, channels, factorizationModel,
    \"Samples\" -> 1, \"ValidationSamples\" -> 1,
    \"MaxCorrectionTerms\" -> 128, \"TimeConstraint\" -> timeLimit]];
completion\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[23]:=",ExpressionUUID->"9c8b8417-1b8b-4a2e-acce-77e8a1662191"],

