}, Open  ]],

Cell["There is only one massless external particle, so no other massless spinor is available for AllSpurious. Automatic uses momentum-insertion references for the constructive diagrams. The independent Feynman benchmark below uses AllPhysical.", "Text"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Generate the Diagrams", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b9557763-dbbc-4f7b-8487-9aa2cc1b2069"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
diagrams = CreateDiagrams[particles, diagramModel];
rawAmplitudes = diagramAmplitudes[diagrams];
Length[rawAmplitudes]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[87]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6427db48-6319-432e-a5b6-5921c1f3110c"],

